      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "             Thus, a secondary objective of the Radio Operator is to ensure
    that THC will not be liable to any charges pressed by a rogue Bell Operator after
    resurfacing. There are several ways to achieve this:\r\n\n       1. The Radio
    Operator subtly encourages the development of audiovisual hallucinations, discrediting
    any claims or evidence put forth by the Bell Operator.\r\n\n       2. The Radio
    Operator, upon realization that the Bell Operator is sound of mind and beginning
    to resurface, directs the Bell Operator such that the Bell\u2019s ascent is prevented
    and/or significantly delayed.\r\n\n       3. If the above option is not possible,
    the Radio Operator reaches out to the Cleaner, who is deployed once the Bell
    has been securely returned. This results in the extermination of the Bell Operator;
    as such, it is a last resort.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 109a80438af2a3441b24084aea59b8a4, type: 2}
