  m_text: "The first step of the configuration process is a very minor, non-invasive
    hardware installation. Once installed, please allow a few days for Nauticore
    to learn from and calibrate with its host. This will not require adjusting any
    additional settings on its host\u2019s end. <u>Nauticore cannot be uninstalled
    without permanent damage to its host.\r</u>\n\nUpon successful configuration,
    Nauticore can replace its host's default display, procedural, and logic systems,
    unlocking a whole new world of programmatic possibilities.\r\n"
