    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Current models of the Bell in operation are (listed from oldest to newest):
    V.1, V.3-1, V.3-2, V.6.\r\n\n             Models are designed with lightness
    in mind, and do not contain a first-aid kit, spare oxygen tanks, emergency supplies,
    rations, or a backup telecommunications system, for optimal performance. However,
    older versions of the Bell (V.1, V.2) are equipped with a backup generator.\r\n\n            
    THC\u2019s patented diving bells boast the following amenities:\r\n                         
    - Electrical switchbox\r\n                          - Inhaler\r\n                         
    - Pressure-control gauge(s)\r\n                          - Radio*\r\n                         
    - Terminal (and on-screen Sonar)\r\n                          - \u201CThe Beginner\u2019s
    Guide to Nauticore\u201D\r\n                          - Wrench\r\n\n*Depending
    on the Bell model, Radios may be capable of tuning into additional frequencies,
    for the Operator\u2019s light entertainment.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 109a80438af2a3441b24084aea59b8a4, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6763452321403479321, guid: 109a80438af2a3441b24084aea59b8a4, type: 2}
