  m_text: "Even within The Halley Company, not much is known about its deep-sea exploration
    initiative, Project: Halley\u2019s Bell. However, ten years in your position
    has you stepping aboard the project as a newly-appointed Operator. Now, it\u2019s
    up to you to sit n\u2019 survive as you descend into a chasm of unknown wonders
    in your diving bell\u2014 hopefully, some of those wonders aren\u2019t trying
    to get you!"
